OL,3,ALatest UK figures on migration and
OL,4,Aasylum claims about to be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest data on net migration, the
OL,7,Fasylum system and visas are about to be
OL,8,Freleased - a reminder of the key terms
OL,10,FNet migration has been falling, with
OL,11,Ffigures in May showing it had dropped
OL,12,Fto 171,000 in 2025 - the lowest level
OL,13,Fsince 2012, excluding the Covid
OL,14,Fpandemic
OL,16,FThe Office for National Statistics will
OL,17,Ftoday publish figures for the year
OL,18,Fending June 2026 - here's what the last
OL,19,Fbatch showed
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
